# admin-ui Core Components

Reusable UI lives in `frontend/projects/admin-ui/src/app/core/components/`. **Use these before `mat-card`, raw `<p>`/`<span>`, or new wrapper components.**

## `app-card` — not `mat-card`

**Path:** `core/components/card/card.component.ts`  
**Selector:** `app-card`

Grouped content panels with optional collapsible header. Project-standard card — do **not** use `MatCardModule` / `<mat-card>`.

```html
<app-card titleText="User Info">
  <div class="flex flex-row w-full flex-wrap gap-4">
    <!-- content via ng-content -->
  </div>
</app-card>
```

| Input | Default | Purpose |
|-------|---------|---------|
| `titleText` | — | Header label; omit for headerless card |
| `collapsible` | `true` | Click header to collapse body |

Import `CardComponent` in the parent `imports` array.

## `app-text` — read-only fields

**Path:** `core/components/text/text.component.ts`  
**Selector:** `app-text`  
**Class:** `AppTextComponent`

Label + formatted value for **display-only** data. Use on detail/view screens and read-only sections — not for editable inputs (`mat-form-field` stays for forms).

```html
<app-text
  class="w-full lg:px-2 lg:w-1/4"
  label="Email"
  [value]="entity.email" />

<app-text
  label="Created"
  type="datetime"
  [value]="entity.createdAt" />

<app-text
  label="Status"
  type="enum"
  [value]="entity.status" />
```

| Input | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `label` | Field label above value |
| `value` | Raw value to format |
| `type` | `date`, `datetime`, `number`, `small-number`, `currency`, `boolean`, `link`, `time-ago`, `enum`, `cardano-tx`, `cardano-address` |
| `showCopy` | Copy-to-clipboard button |
| `currency` | ISO code when `type="currency"` |
| `link` | `routerLink` target when `type="link"` |

Omit `type` for plain strings. Shows `N/A` when value is null/undefined.

**Bad:** `<p>{{ entity.email }}</p>` or `<mat-label>Email</mat-label><span>…</span>` on a view screen.  
**Good:** `<app-text label="Email" [value]="entity.email" />`

## Other core components

| Component | Selector | Use for |
|-----------|----------|---------|
| `SpinnerComponent` | `app-spinner` | Loading overlay |
| `SectionDividerComponent` | `app-section-divider` | Titled subsection inside a card |
| `ValidationErrorComponent` | `app-validation-error` | Form validation messages |

